# No Cursor attribution in commits

When creating git commits:

- **Do not** add `Co-Authored-By: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, `Done by Cursor`, or any similar Cursor / AI attribution trailer or sentence.
- Keep commit messages normal project-style messages only (what/why), with no agent branding.
